{"title":"아찔한 남사친 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"“우리 6개월만 연애할래?”아버지의 지속적인 선 강요에 지친 채윤. 6개월 후에 해외 연수를 갈 계획을 세우며 소꿉친구 태산에게 계약 연애를 제안한다.“강채윤, 나 좋아하냐?”“내가 미쳤어! 애인이라도 있으면 그 지긋지긋한 선을 안 봐도 될 거 아니야.”“그러니까, 날 방패로 쓰시겠다.”태산은 눈을 반짝이는 채윤을 바라보며 의미심장한 미소를 짓곤 말했다.“근데 난 애인이랑 하고 싶은 게 많은데……. 네가 감당할 수 있을까?”“당연하지! 뭐든 말만 해.”“그래. 6개월, 네 애인을 해 주는 대신 애인으로서 할 수 있는 모든 걸 다 할 거야.채윤이 가족 같은 남사친, 태산의 시한부 애인이 된 순간이었다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":102,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":116,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":159,"change":{"type":"down","amount":43}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":183,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":230,"change":{"type":"down","amount":47}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":257,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":181,"change":{"type":"up","amount":76}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":212,"change":{"type":"down","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":249,"change":{"type":"down","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":247,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":235,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":299,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-01","rank":248,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":169,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":129,"change":{"type":"up","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":123,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":114,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":113,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":107,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":96,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":140,"change":{"type":"down","amount":44}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":163,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date